      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That's the Mandragora!\r\nA plant with arms and legs, walking on two feet\r\nlike a human, charming as a cat, yet it sprouts\r\nlike a tree—how mysterious, strange, and adorable!",
        "Jp" : "それが《マンドラゴラ》！\r\n植物なのに手足があって、人のように二足で歩き\r\n猫のように愛嬌があって、木のように生えてくる――\r\nなんて不思議で、奇妙で、可愛いんだ！"
